# Audit report: o/r, 2026-10-11T00:00:00Z to 2026-10-12T04:00:00Z

Written by `aayu audit` (docs/BUILD-PLAN.md WP7.6). GitHub's own event history is the source of record (ground rule 6);
the actions segments on the ledger are reconciled against it.

Regenerate this report byte for byte, with the same configuration, from the GitHub inputs snapshot written beside it
(GitHub's history is mutable, and rule suites are listed for a month), or re-read GitHub with the same inputs:

