## Licence scan

Every go.mod requirement of the code commit needs a THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md row with the same version and an allowed
licence; the CI `security` job runs go-licenses and the npm licence check on the same commit.

- `github.com/b/missing` v0.1.0 is not in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
