## Sources and retention

- Rule suites: `GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}/rulesets/rule-suites` (repository admin), listed for at most the last month;
  the GitHub inputs snapshot keeps them, so `--replay` reproduces this report after GitHub stops listing them.
- Issue and pull request timelines, merged pull requests, and workflow runs: GitHub REST, read up to the cursor.
- Ledger: proof packs, ship records, Ready snapshots, actions segments, and earlier audit reports at the ledger commit.
- Earlier reports (hand-run or `aayu audit`) on the ledger account for bypasses they list by rule-suite ID.
